<section class="section container faq"><p class="eyebrow">A FLEXIBLE PLAN IS A GOOD PLAN</p><h2>Before choosing the ridge.</h2><details><summary>Is the photographed ridge the actual route?</summary><p>No. The approved landscape photograph is illustrative stock. The route names, distances and timings are fictional examples, not directions for a real walk.</p></details><details><summary>Are dates or prices available?</summary><p>This is a sample brand, so there are no available departures or bookable prices. The inquiry form demonstrates the information a guiding conversation might begin with.</p></details><details><summary>What would change the plan?</summary><p>Wind, visibility, ground conditions and the needs of the group could all mean taking a lower route, shortening the day or postponing. The ridge is always optional.</p></details></section>
